\caption{Performance of \Tool when forcing the model to activate one \expertadapter or \nladapter in the \describe (top) and \synthesis (bottom) tasks. The red dotted line in each subplot represents the performance of the \Tool variant when activating the correct adapter matching the input/output.}
\label{fig:mismatch}
