\subsection{CONUS404 Dataset} \label{Sec: data}
The publicly available CONUS404 dataset \cite{rasmussen2023conus404, Rasmussen2023CONUSData}, provides hourly hydroclimate reanalysis at a 4 km spatial resolution over the conterminous United States (CONUS) for water years 1980–2021. This data offers a realistic platform for examining how morning SM and other factors influence afternoon precipitation. We focus on warm-season diurnal SMPC processes by selecting data from April to September over the 2012–2021 period, analyzing afternoon-to-midnight (12:00–24:00 local time) precipitation. Morning conditions of SM and other land–atmosphere variables are used as antecedent states within our SMPC analysis framework. 
