     three pairwise independent in-stars with $p_1=2$, $p_2 = 3$, and $p_3 = 2$ depicted using dashed, normal, and dotted lines, respectively. 
     Note that the arcs that follow from transitivity are not shown; however, such arcs could also be a part of an in-star.}
