\section{Algebraic prolongations for $D(2,1;a)$}\label{S3}

In this section, we compute prolongations of $\fm$ and more generally of $\fg_{\leq k}$ for 6 
gradations of $\fg=D(2,1;a)$. We will use both spectral sequences and direct computations based on 
\eqref{conditionprolongation}. Tedious and repeated computations will be shortened or delegated to
the appendix. The result has an independent computer verification, which is based on integer
arithmetic and hence has full mathematical rigor. 

