\section{Geometric realizations as symmetries}\label{S4}

Let $G$ be an exceptional Lie supergroup $G$ of type $D(2,1;a)$ (for instance, $\exp\fg$) and $P$ its
parabolic subgroup marked according to the choice of parabolic subalgebra $\fp\subset\g$.
For each such choice, we will construct a geometry on the homogeneous superspace $G/P$, see
\cite{CCF,Va} for details on super quotients and \cite{V1,G3F4A} for examples of flag supermanifolds. 


