$N_e$ & Number of primary control microphones\\
$N_z$ & Number of secondary control microphones\\
$N_r$ & Number of reference microphones\\
$N_t$ & Number of filter co-efficients \\
$p_e[t]$ & Primary path impulse response to primary control \\
& microphones\\
$p_z[t]$ & Primary path impulse response to secondary control \\
&microphones\\
$g_{e,s}[t]$ & Secondary path impulse response to primary control \\ & microphones\\
$\mathbf{X}_e[t]$ & Reference microphone signals filtered by impulse \\ &responses for primary control microphones\\
$g_{z,s}[t]$ & Secondary path impulse response to secondary control \\ &microphones\\
$\mathbf{X}_z[t]$ & Reference microphone signals filtered by impulse \\ &responses to secondary control microphones\\
