The second system we analyzed is the antithetic\cite{Briat}, which is presented as a synthetic controller that can be easily implemented in various systems, as shown in Figure \ref{fig.02}. Under the deterministic regime, this system exhibits either a stationary point for certain parameter regimes or a stable limit cycle for others. 

